DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
30065::$$$message_0220_0000_0000$$$::Spider threads hang down into a hell of eternal torment.[lr]::
30066::$$$message_0220_0000_0001$$$::Masses of husks climb out of the underworld, beckoned by the omens in the sky.[lr]::
30067::$$$message_0220_0000_0002$$$::Tonight, the time is nigh.[lr]::
30068::$$$message_0220_0000_0003$$$::It is the end of the fourth night, when this war returns to the beginning.::
30069::$$$message_0220_0001_0000$$$::                                          "HUrRy, hurrY, HUrRY, HurRY..."[rf]::
30070::$$$message_0220_0002_0000$$$::They're like ants swarming to honey.[lr]::
30071::$$$message_0220_0002_0001$$$::The husks revive from the pit in order to drive off their own body, which is about to break free from the cycle of reincarnation.::
30072::$$$message_0220_0003_0000$$$::"dOn'T lET HIm GET AWay, DoN'T Let him gET AWAy, DOn't let HIm Get AWAY, DON'T leT Him GeT awAY..."[rf]::
30073::$$$message_0220_0004_0000$$$::There will be no nights beyond this one.[lr]::
30074::$$$message_0220_0004_0001$$$::The husks multiply endlessly, drowning the town with their numbers.::
30075::$$$message_0220_0005_0000$$$::                                            "[dash textoff=0 mx=0 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=400 imag=3.1 time=200 cy=525 mag=2.7 my=11 storage=44＠残骸(最多) rot=-0.0 accel=3]CruSH,[wdash canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=100] [dash textoff=0 mx=0 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=400 imag=2.6 time=200 cy=525 mag=2.1 my=11 storage=44＠残骸(最多) rot=-0.0 accel=3]cruSh,[wdash canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=100] [dash mx=0 textoff=0 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=396 imag=4.1 time=200 cy=142 mag=3.3 my=-50 storage=44＠残骸(最多) rot=-0.0 accel=3]crUsh,[wdash canskip=0] [wait canskip=0 time=100][dash textoff=0 mx=0 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=400 imag=3.5 time=100 cy=7 mag=1 my=0 storage=44＠残骸(最多) rot=-0.0 accel=3]KIlL...!"[wdash canskip=0][rf]::
30076::$$$message_0220_0006_0000$$$::They are Pandemonium itself[line len=2][lr]::
30077::$$$message_0220_0006_0001$$$::A hell with a will of its own to kill oneself, incarnated to bury the night...::
30078::$$$message_0220_0007_0000$$$::"Damn. Well done. Aren't they afraid of that thing?"[lr]::
30079::$$$message_0220_0007_0001$$$::She murmurs quietly, looking up at the stairs.[lr]::
30080::$$$message_0220_0007_0002$$$::They extend at least two kilometers high into the distant sky.::
30081::$$$message_0220_0008_0000$$$::"...This is all so ridiculous.[lr]::
30082::$$$message_0220_0008_0001$$$::I guess it'd be boorish of me to complain if they care that much about looking girly."[lr]::
30083::$$$message_0220_0008_0002$$$::She shrugs.[lr]::
30084::$$$message_0220_0008_0003$$$::It's a primitive stage set piece, but she still has to admit that it makes an impressive spectacle.::
30085::$$$message_0220_0009_0000$$$::A bridge of light divides the heavens in two.[lr]::
30086::$$$message_0220_0009_0001$$$::The protagonist and the princess ascend the transparent stairs, hand in hand.[lr]::
30087::$$$message_0220_0009_0002$$$::It isn't a sight that happens often even in fairy tales.[lr]::
30088::$$$message_0220_0009_0003$$$::The situation on the surface is desperate, but she still can't stop herself from quipping.::
30089::$$$message_0220_0010_0000$$$::"...Still, aren't there too many of these things?"[lr]::
30090::$$$message_0220_0010_0001$$$::She looks down from her chosen position on the steel arch supporting the bridge.[lr]::
30091::$$$message_0220_0010_0002$$$::Miyama is shrouded in darkness.[lr]::
30092::$$$message_0220_0010_0003$$$::The fourth day is ending, and the town is rapidly changing.::
30093::$$$message_0220_0011_0000$$$::Lights blink out, people vanish, and the town's vitality freezes.[lr]::
30094::$$$message_0220_0011_0001$$$::In this place, at this time...[lr]::
30095::$$$message_0220_0011_0002$$$::...only those who fought in the Holy Grail War still exist.[lr]::
30096::$$$message_0220_0011_0003$$$::Day and night, which have never mingled before, switch places, and people who never met encounter each other.[lr]::
30097::$$$message_0220_0011_0004$$$::It is a joining of fantasy and reality, of truth and untruth.[stopnoise][lr]::
30098::$$$message_0220_0011_0005$$$::This meager one-hour interval is the borderline separating the fourth and fifth days.::
30099::$$$message_0220_0012_0000$$$::"...I knew that.[lr]::
30100::$$$message_0220_0012_0001$$$::But I never imagined this would happen."[lr]::
30101::$$$message_0220_0012_0002$$$::They overran Miyama in less than half an hour.[lr]::
30102::$$$message_0220_0012_0003$$$::...To a human, they may as well have been infinite.[lr]::
30103::$$$message_0220_0012_0004$$$::No matter how numerous it is, no matter how much it exceeds human estimation, everything has a limit.[lr]::
30104::$$$message_0220_0012_0005$$$::"Infinite" is just a word to describe something beyond perceiving.[lr]::
30105::$$$message_0220_0012_0006$$$::However, what she is looking at now isn't merely "countless."::
30106::$$$message_0220_0013_0000$$$::They are truly infinite.[lr]::
30107::$$$message_0220_0013_0001$$$::Continuous proliferation without end.[lr]::
30108::$$$message_0220_0013_0002$$$::An apocalyptic army, from alpha to omega.[lr]::
30109::$$$message_0220_0013_0003$$$::An utterly unstoppable apoptosis with no ability to slam on the brakes.[lr]::
30110::$$$message_0220_0013_0004$$$::The end of an out-of-control ecosystem engulfs the earth.::
30111::$$$message_0220_0014_0000$$$::"Five hundred, six hundred... No, there must be over a thousand just within my field of view..."[lr]::
30112::$$$message_0220_0014_0001$$$::Her stockpiled Mystic Codes and the jewels in her hands feel completely incapable of this task.[lr]::
30113::$$$message_0220_0014_0002$$$::They won't be enough to delay this for even a few minutes.[lr]::
30114::$$$message_0220_0014_0003$$$::Those things will collapse the bridge instantly, overrun Shinto's skyscrapers, and ravenously bring down the spider's threads on everything.::
30115::$$$message_0220_0015_0000$$$::"Rrgh..."[lr]::
30116::$$$message_0220_0015_0001$$$::She grits her teeth, staring down at the end.[lr]::
30117::$$$message_0220_0015_0002$$$::If the earth is hell and the sky is a fairy-tale world, then the steel arch she stands on is the boundary.[lr]::
30118::$$$message_0220_0015_0003$$$::She stands on the precipice of either realm, gazing at the end of the distant sea.::
30119::$$$message_0220_0016_0000$$$::A vapor trail cuts straight across the sky.[lr]::
30120::$$$message_0220_0016_0001$$$::An endless toxic swarm mills below her eyes.[lr]::
30121::$$$message_0220_0016_0002$$$::If she had to choose which way to go, it would be...::
30122::$$$message_0220_0017_0000$$$::"There's nothing to debate.[lr]::
30123::$$$message_0220_0017_0001$$$::I'm a Tohsaka mage, and this town is my responsibility."[lr]::
30124::$$$message_0220_0017_0002$$$::She squeezes the jewels in her hands.[lr]::
30125::$$$message_0220_0017_0003$$$::She won't look up at the sky again.[lr]::
30126::$$$message_0220_0017_0004$$$::She's charged herself with the duty to guard this border.[lr]::
30127::$$$message_0220_0017_0005$$$::But...::
30128::$$$message_0220_0018_0000$$$::"Hah... huff..."[lr]::
30129::$$$message_0220_0018_0001$$$::She can't steady her breathing.[lr]::
30130::$$$message_0220_0018_0002$$$::The more she looks down there, the harder she grits her teeth.[lr]::
30131::$$$message_0220_0018_0003$$$::Her stiff legs lack their usual lightness, and an inexplicable pressure numbs her shoulders.::
30132::$$$message_0220_0019_0000$$$::"...Ngh...!"[lr]::
30133::$$$message_0220_0019_0001$$$::The husks begin their advance.[lr]::
30134::$$$message_0220_0019_0002$$$::They'll breach the boundary.[lr]::
30135::$$$message_0220_0019_0003$$$::She has to break the vanguard's advance first.[lr]::
30136::$$$message_0220_0019_0004$$$::But she's trembling so badly, she can't take a single step forward.::
30137::$$$message_0220_0020_0000$$$::"...Argh, I'm pathetic!"[lr]::
30138::$$$message_0220_0020_0001$$$::She punches herself in the forehead.[lr]::
30139::$$$message_0220_0020_0002$$$::She'd known all along that she was at a disadvantage.[lr]::
30140::$$$message_0220_0020_0003$$$::Now that she's taken up position here, the only thing to do is to fight until her power runs out.::
30141::$$$message_0220_0021_0000$$$::"...[font italic=true]Anfang. (Set.)[font italic=false]"[lr]::
30142::$$$message_0220_0021_0001$$$::She moves her stony legs and takes a step toward the horde below.[lr]::
30143::$$$message_0220_0021_0002$$$::No retreat.[lr]::
30144::$$$message_0220_0021_0003$$$::The next step will plunge her into a land of death.::
30145::$$$message_0220_0022_0000$$$::"...Hmm. It's all well and good to have passion, but aren't your shoulders too tense?[lr]::
30146::$$$message_0220_0022_0001$$$::Well, I must say it's very like you to attempt to massacre everyone else in a fight."::
30147::$$$message_0220_0023_0000$$$::"...Eh?"[lr]::
30148::$$$message_0220_0023_0001$$$::A terribly familiar voice takes the wind out of her sails.::
30149::$$$message_0220_0024_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=false time=1000][say storage=eming13_rin_0120 name=凛]Now hold on.[lr]::
30150::$$$message_0220_0024_0001$$$::Massacre? What's that supposed to mean? [l][say storage=eming13_rin_0122 name=凛]I carried myself like a compassionate honor student in London, you know."[lr]::
30151::$$$message_0220_0024_0002$$$::The tension leaves her mind.[lr]::
30152::$$$message_0220_0024_0003$$$::She stops and complains without turning around.::
30153::$$$message_0220_0025_0000$$$::"Oh, I meant it literally.[lr]::
30154::$$$message_0220_0025_0001$$$::It's not your style to make the first move, but to make sure anyone who picks a fight with you can never fight again. It's just a matter of whether you show mercy before or after, am I right?"[lr]::
30155::$$$message_0220_0025_0002$$$::"...Mrgh."[lr]::
30156::$$$message_0220_0025_0003$$$::She hates to admit it, but it's true.[lr]::
30157::$$$message_0220_0025_0004$$$::Her philosophy is to go [font italic=true]all the way[font italic=false] once she starts.[lr]::
30158::$$$message_0220_0025_0005$$$::A passive strategy like whether she can hold the line and for how long never suited her to begin with.::
30159::$$$message_0220_0026_0000$$$::"...Yeah, I may as well try to annihilate them.[lr]::
30160::$$$message_0220_0026_0001$$$::This isn't a borderline, but a frontline.[lr]::
30161::$$$message_0220_0026_0002$$$::...I screwed up. No wonder I was so tense. I couldn't even figure out that much."[lr]::
30162::$$$message_0220_0026_0003$$$::She rolls her shoulders to loosen them.[lr]::
30163::$$$message_0220_0026_0004$$$::The bases are loaded with no outs in the bottom of the ninth inning; the second batter is up, and the game's over if they score even one point.[lr]::
30164::$$$message_0220_0026_0005$$$::The pitcher was just focused on protecting their score, but she's now driven to strike the batter out.::
30165::$$$message_0220_0027_0000$$$::"There's still too many.[lr]::
30166::$$$message_0220_0027_0001$$$::I'm not fighting to lose, but I could still get blindsided... Okay, we'll sink the whole bridge if we have to!"[lr]::
30167::$$$message_0220_0027_0002$$$::"...Wait. I'm glad you're back in good spirits, but that would be excessive.[lr]::
30168::$$$message_0220_0027_0003$$$::We'll lose control of the situation if the bridge is destroyed. The enemy is simple-minded. Once the bridge falls, they'll attempt to ford the river and assault Shinto from every direction. But as long as the bridge remains intact, they'll concentrate themselves at one point."::
30169::$$$message_0220_0028_0000$$$::"Argh... F-fine. I was just getting into the moment."[lr]::
30170::$$$message_0220_0028_0001$$$::She clicks her tongue in disappointment.[lr]::
30171::$$$message_0220_0028_0002$$$::She just wanted to say that if their back was to the wall, it would be nice to take out a bridge or two and go out with a bang.::
30172::$$$message_0220_0029_0000$$$::"You're still like that through and through, aren't you.[lr]::
30173::$$$message_0220_0029_0001$$$::I thought you might've learned some class in the last half year."[lr]::
30174::$$$message_0220_0029_0002$$$::"I was born this way. And you still have a habit of not knowing when to keep your mouth shut."[lr]::
30175::$$$message_0220_0029_0003$$$::"I just match whoever I'm talking to. Right now, I'm contracted with a Master who needs a friendly warning from time to time."[lr]::
30176::$$$message_0220_0029_0004$$$::"What a coincidence. I just happen to have a familiar who talks too much."::
30177::$$$message_0220_0030_0000$$$::It's a petty, unproductive conversation, but she grins anyway.[lr]::
30178::$$$message_0220_0030_0001$$$::The army of husks is advancing directly beneath them.[lr]::
30179::$$$message_0220_0030_0002$$$::This is their last chance to fire the opening salvo.::
30180::$$$message_0220_0031_0000$$$::"...Okay. Will you stick with me, Archer?"[lr]::
30181::$$$message_0220_0031_0001$$$::"Yeah. A Servant obeys its Master.[lr]::
30182::$$$message_0220_0031_0002$$$::Now..."[lr]::
30183::$$$message_0220_0031_0003$$$::"...I can finally fight without holding back."[lr]::
30184::$$$message_0220_0031_0004$$$::A red cloak appears out of thin air.[lr]::
30185::$$$message_0220_0031_0005$$$::The bowman flourishes his iconic holy shroud, as if to protect her.::
30186::$$$message_0220_0032_0000$$$::That he's wearing this armor can mean only one thing: [lr]::
30187::$$$message_0220_0032_0001$$$::he is with his Master on a battlefield worthy of his presence.[lr]::
30188::$$$message_0220_0032_0002$$$::Discarded homesickness burns in his chest.[lr]::
30189::$$$message_0220_0032_0003$$$::For just one moment,[lr]::
30190::$$$message_0220_0032_0004$$$::in this hour before dawn, he's returned to the form that once fought by her side.::
30191::$$$message_0220_0033_0000$$$::"...You jerk. Why'd you have to make such a big deal out of weird things? I can't tell if you're being forthright or just a snob."[lr]::
30192::$$$message_0220_0033_0001$$$::"I gave in to my forthrightness, you could say.[lr]::
30193::$$$message_0220_0033_0002$$$::After all, I'm putting my life on the line for a cause I don't understand, against an enemy I don't understand.[lr]::
30194::$$$message_0220_0033_0003$$$::...You really should learn to give less of a damn. This sort of chivalry won't earn you any favors."[lr]::
30195::$$$message_0220_0033_0004$$$::"Haha. Yeah, that was one expensive right hook."::
30196::$$$message_0220_0034_0000$$$::She watches the enemy.[lr]::
30197::$$$message_0220_0034_0001$$$::She applies half of her magical energy to her Magic Crest and limits its rotation speed to a moderate level.[lr]::
30198::$$$message_0220_0034_0002$$$::It's going to be a long fight.[lr]::
30199::$$$message_0220_0034_0003$$$::She has to defend this bridge until that bridge of light in the sky disappears.::
30200::$$$message_0220_0035_0000$$$::"We'll let them make the first attack. Once we wipe out their vanguard, then we'll drop down to the bridge.[lr]::
30201::$$$message_0220_0035_0001$$$::After that, it'll be a battle of attrition. You can punch holes in their ranks from here, while I'll cut down anyone who escapes your fire.[lr]::
30202::$$$message_0220_0035_0002$$$::Any problems with that, Rin?"[lr]::
30203::$$$message_0220_0035_0003$$$::"No objections here. Some of them will probably still slip through, but we can ignore them.[lr]::
30204::$$$message_0220_0035_0004$$$::Our job is to wipe out the mass of the army. We can consider any unexpected risks once we deal with what's in front of us."::
30205::$$$message_0220_0036_0000$$$::She doesn't know how many are going to break through their battle line.[lr]::
30206::$$$message_0220_0036_0001$$$::There are probably enemies crossing the river directly toward Shinto, as well.[lr]::
30207::$$$message_0220_0036_0002$$$::But that's one in a thousand.[lr]::
30208::$$$message_0220_0036_0003$$$::She can only wait for the important people up above to take care of any such irregularities.::
30209::$$$message_0220_0037_0000$$$::"...There are probably others who can't mind their own business either, so we can leave those to them."[lr]::
30210::$$$message_0220_0037_0001$$$::Light fills Rin's Crest.[lr]::
30211::$$$message_0220_0037_0002$$$::In one graceful motion, she uses the shortest process to unleash the power and magecraft imbued in her jewels.::
30212::$$$message_0220_0038_0000$$$::"...[font italic=true]Anfang. (Set.)[font italic=false]"[lr]::
30213::$$$message_0220_0038_0001$$$::Large flowers bloom on the blackened earth.[lr]::
30214::$$$message_0220_0038_0002$$$::Magical flames signal the start of the battle. They become stars illuminating the skybound path...::
30215::$$$message_0220_0039_0000$$$::Venomous fangs obliterate the husks.[lr]::
30216::$$$message_0220_0039_0001$$$::Forehead, throat, heart, spine.[lr]::
30217::$$$message_0220_0039_0002$$$::Each strike is dealt swiftly and precisely by iron fists.[lr]::
30218::$$$message_0220_0039_0003$$$::A demonic avatar stands against the horde of the dead.[lr]::
30219::$$$message_0220_0039_0004$$$::With lethal force, he pounds the creeping dead back down to hell!::
30220::$$$message_0220_0040_0000$$$::Three kills for every one breath.[lr]::
30221::$$$message_0220_0040_0001$$$::The witch has Strengthened his fists into iron hammers that crush the dead faces.[lr]::
30222::$$$message_0220_0040_0002$$$::But his blows are shallow.[lr]::
30223::$$$message_0220_0040_0003$$$::Their claws won't stop, even if their faces and innards are destroyed.[lr]::
30224::$$$message_0220_0040_0004$$$::The dead aren't moved by their beating hearts, but by pure hatred.[lr]::
30225::$$$message_0220_0040_0005$$$::The curses will run wild until the heads and limbs are shattered!::
30226::$$$message_0220_0041_0000$$$::"Assassin."[lr]::
30227::$$$message_0220_0041_0001$$$::"No need to thank me, Souichirou. Enemies that don't falter when punched and don't die when cut are a poor match for either of us."[lr]::
30228::$$$message_0220_0041_0002$$$::His unconcerned voice is out of place on the battlefield.[lr]::
30229::$$$message_0220_0041_0003$$$::Moonlight gleams along the samurai's five-shaku blade as he steps toward the dead swarm.[lr]::
30230::$$$message_0220_0041_0004$$$::The sword moves like a dance.[lr]::
30231::$$$message_0220_0041_0005$$$::The dead don't even know they've been cut until they hit the ground.::
30232::$$$message_0220_0042_0000$$$::"Hmm. They do stop moving once they lose their limbs.[lr]::
30233::$$$message_0220_0042_0001$$$::Souichirou. I know it is a hassle, but I recommend targeting their limbs instead of their heads. I know it runs counter to your creed of one kill per blow, but it's a sound tactic for fighting wooden dummies!"[lr]::
30234::$$$message_0220_0042_0002$$$::"..."::
30235::$$$message_0220_0043_0000$$$::Flowers and grass.[lr]::
30236::$$$message_0220_0043_0001$$$::They may differ in their being, but expert martial artists need no words to communicate.[lr]::
30237::$$$message_0220_0043_0002$$$::Blade and fist intersect, [move textoff=0 spread=1 mx=400 magnify=1.6 time=300 my=300 path=(400,300,255,1.4)(400,300,128,1.2)(400,300,0,1) storage=z未定008 accel=0]overwhelming the milling enemies.[lr]::
30238::$$$message_0220_0043_0003$$$::[move textoff=0 spread=1 mx=400 magnify=1.6 time=300 my=300 path=(400,300,255,1.4)(400,300,128,1.2)(400,300,0,1) storage=l03変化b accel=0]Backs to one another, the two demons rush through the battlefield, crushing the dead at a dizzying speed...!::
30239::$$$message_0220_0044_0000$$$::"Why the change of heart, Souichirou? You overlooked the husks until tonight, but now you go to meet them in battle.[lr]::
30240::$$$message_0220_0044_0001$$$::Or did your witch simply overlook all this strangeness?"[lr]::
30241::$$$message_0220_0044_0002$$$::"...I don't know. If this bores you, Assassin, then go back to sleep.[lr]::
30242::$$$message_0220_0044_0003$$$::These wraiths will disappear once you sleep. They pose no danger to those who dream."::
30243::$$$message_0220_0045_0000$$$::He explains that this is why he's ignored the shadows roaming the town at night.[lr]::
30244::$$$message_0220_0045_0001$$$::But that too is strange.[lr]::
30245::$$$message_0220_0045_0002$$$::By that logic, he could just go to sleep tonight as well.[lr]::
30246::$$$message_0220_0045_0003$$$::No matter how many there are, they won't threaten the humans who are asleep.::
30247::$$$message_0220_0046_0000$$$::"Oh? Then why go through the trouble now?[lr]::
30248::$$$message_0220_0046_0001$$$::I don't know whether I'll pass on or go back, but if you sleep now, you can still return to your daily life."[lr]::
30249::$$$message_0220_0046_0002$$$::"True. But she desires this war. I can hardly ignore that."::
30250::$$$message_0220_0047_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
30251::$$$message_0220_0047_0001$$$::Assassin's sword wavers slightly.[lr]::
30252::$$$message_0220_0047_0002$$$::His expression stiffens in surprise.::
30253::$$$message_0220_0048_0000$$$::"I see, indeed![lr]::
30254::$$$message_0220_0048_0001$$$::Haha, I thought she'd never ask you for anything, but even that Caster has changed her ways![lr]::
30255::$$$message_0220_0048_0002$$$::My, my. That's such an adorable side of her[line len=2]"[lr]::
30256::$$$message_0220_0048_0003$$$::"Argh, silence, you good-for-nothing idiot!"::
30257::$$$message_0220_0049_0000$$$::Bolts of light rain down from above.[lr]::
30258::$$$message_0220_0049_0001$$$::The witch's hammer becomes a squall that washes the dark filth away.::
30259::$$$message_0220_0050_0000$$$::"Ahh, as I suspected, demonic arts are more effective against such abominations.[lr]::
30260::$$$message_0220_0050_0001$$$::You must be in your element, Caster! Your false virtue is especially lively tonight!"[lr]::
30261::$$$message_0220_0050_0002$$$::"Enough drivel, Assassin. I told you that your duty is to support my Master. If you can't even do that, then I'll burn you along with these weaklings."::
30262::$$$message_0220_0051_0000$$$::"Haha, calm yourself. I know that you want to fight alongside Souichirou. Just like you, your Master's happiness is my happiness. Your happiness is my happiness, too.[lr]::
30263::$$$message_0220_0051_0001$$$::Which means we can somewhat cut loose. Surely you can understand as a man, Souichirou. I can see you swinging those fists with unusual vigor tonight."[lr]::
30264::$$$message_0220_0051_0002$$$::"...Sorry. I'm in front of my wife, so I cannot hold back.[lr]::
30265::$$$message_0220_0051_0003$$$::...I've made more work for you, Caster."::
30266::$$$message_0220_0052_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
30267::$$$message_0220_0052_0001$$$::They're shocked.[lr]::
30268::$$$message_0220_0052_0002$$$::Anyone who knows Kuzuki would understand how bizarre his words just were.::
30269::$$$message_0220_0053_0000$$$::"Caster, new enemies approach.[lr]::
30270::$$$message_0220_0053_0001$$$::Whether we defend Ryudou Temple or stop this at the source, there's no time to have a discussion.[lr]::
30271::$$$message_0220_0053_0002$$$::I'll let you make the orders. Fight according to your wishes... [wvl canskip=false time=600]This opportunity will probably not come again."[lr]::
30272::$$$message_0220_0053_0003$$$::"Souichirou..."::
30273::$$$message_0220_0054_0000$$$::Is he trying to tell her not to have any regrets?[lr]::
30274::$$$message_0220_0054_0001$$$::Souichirou Kuzuki honors her wishes,[lr]::
30275::$$$message_0220_0054_0002$$$::and the witch, who can't bear to let this life end, accepts his offer with unknowable sadness.::
30276::$$$message_0220_0055_0000$$$::"...Yes. I understand, Master.[lr]::
30277::$$$message_0220_0055_0001$$$::I won't hesitate anymore to stay true to my wishes."[lr]::
30278::$$$message_0220_0055_0002$$$::The bells on her staff ring.[lr]::
30279::$$$message_0220_0055_0003$$$::The mage from the Age of Gods begins weaving yet another sacrament.::
30280::$$$message_0220_0056_0000$$$::"What are we going to do, Caster?[lr]::
30281::$$$message_0220_0056_0001$$$::You'll soon get bored of this. Why not go crush them at the source[line len=2]"[wvs][sestop time=5000 nowait=1][lr]::
30282::$$$message_0220_0056_0002$$$::"Hmph. You've got some nerve to propose that, Assassin, when you can't even leave the gate.[lr]::
30283::$$$message_0220_0056_0003$$$::First of all, I have no obligation to help them that much. I only need to defend this place. I'm only going to teach this garbage a lesson for shamelessly intruding in someone's home."::
30284::$$$message_0220_0057_0000$$$::Dark shadows appear without end.[lr]::
30285::$$$message_0220_0057_0001$$$::They come from the back of the mountain, and many descend into Miyama, but the swarm is so large that some of the husks are pushing up to Ryudou Temple.[lr]::
30286::$$$message_0220_0057_0002$$$::Caster is most unhappy about that.[lr]::
30287::$$$message_0220_0057_0003$$$::If the goal was only to protect themselves, then she could just lock her Master inside her temple.[lr]::
30288::$$$message_0220_0057_0004$$$::A Bounded Field to prevent the dead from advancing would have been enough to protect the two of them.::
30289::$$$message_0220_0058_0000$$$::But, by some change of heart, Caster decided not to follow that logic.[lr]::
30290::$$$message_0220_0058_0001$$$::As the army advanced, some happened to taint Ryudou Temple's grounds.[lr]::
30291::$$$message_0220_0058_0002$$$::She could not tolerate their presence, and burned them all away.[lr]::
30292::$$$message_0220_0058_0003$$$::As a result, the husks recognized this location as a threat, and converged on Ryudou Temple.::
30293::$$$message_0220_0059_0000$$$::"Naturally, I couldn't care less about what's going on below. Anyone who steps foot in this house is my enemy.[lr]::
30294::$$$message_0220_0059_0001$$$::...Yes, I'll burn them all away for you, Avenger.[lr]::
30295::$$$message_0220_0059_0002$$$::That's what you want, I'm sure..."[lr]::
30296::$$$message_0220_0059_0003$$$::A divine incantation fills the air.[lr]::
30297::$$$message_0220_0059_0004$$$::Not only is this grand magecraft more than enough to protect Ryudou Temple, it's powerful enough to punch a hole in the main host of their army.::
30298::$$$message_0220_0060_0000$$$::"To be honest...[lr]::
30299::$$$message_0220_0060_0001$$$::I wanted this to go on longer, and now I'm going to take that frustration out on you!"::
30300::$$$message_0220_0061_0000$$$::The witch protecting Ryudou Temple incinerates the corpses threatening the town.[lr]::
30301::$$$message_0220_0061_0001$$$::No matter how infinite they are, they won't recover their numbers right away.[lr]::
30302::$$$message_0220_0061_0002$$$::An arcane strike akin to divine retribution has torn a seam in Pandemonium.::
30303::$$$message_0220_0062_0000$$$::...But they still boil up out of the ground.[lr]::
30304::$$$message_0220_0062_0001$$$::Half of the area below is still overrun by the husks.[lr]::
30305::$$$message_0220_0062_0002$$$::She will protect this place no matter what, and that bridge will greet the next day intact as well.::
30306::$$$message_0220_0063_0000$$$::"...Still, Miyama is beyond saving.[lr]::
30307::$$$message_0220_0063_0001$$$::I can tell those kids are doing their best, but this is far as they go..."[lr]::
30308::$$$message_0220_0063_0002$$$::With sympathy or pity, the witch sighs and looks down at the town.[lr]::
30309::$$$message_0220_0063_0003$$$::...She's watching the north. There's a gap the size of a pinhole around a certain samurai mansion.::
30310::$$$message_0220_0064_0000$$$::A wave of husks swallows the Emiya residence.[lr]::
30311::$$$message_0220_0064_0001$$$::Even the Servant Rider cannot stem the tide on her own.[lr]::
30312::$$$message_0220_0064_0002$$$::If it was just a single wave, she might be able to use her Noble Phantasm to lay waste to them, or petrify them in their tracks with her Mystic Eyes.[lr]::
30313::$$$message_0220_0064_0003$$$::But the enemy is infinite.[lr]::
30314::$$$message_0220_0064_0004$$$::Noble Phantasms and Mystic Eyes consume a great amount of magical energy.[lr]::
30315::$$$message_0220_0064_0005$$$::She'd be able to draw on great power for a moment, only to run out of magical energy and become unable to resist at all.::
30316::$$$message_0220_0065_0000$$$::"Behind you, Rider!"[lr]::
30317::$$$message_0220_0065_0001$$$::Rider's hair whips around in response to her Master's voice.::
30318::$$$message_0220_0066_0000$$$::Claws and blades clash.[lr]::
30319::$$$message_0220_0066_0001$$$::There's nowhere to retreat.[lr]::
30320::$$$message_0220_0066_0002$$$::The husks have come over the walls, practically fighting each other to get to Rider.[lr]::
30321::$$$message_0220_0066_0003$$$::With her speed, it would be easy to evade their claws.[lr]::
30322::$$$message_0220_0066_0004$$$::But the densely clustered monsters present a forest of claws that's more like a spear formation closing in on Rider...!::
30323::$$$message_0220_0067_0000$$$::"Sakura!?"[lr]::
30324::$$$message_0220_0067_0001$$$::Rider skids to a stop.[lr]::
30325::$$$message_0220_0067_0002$$$::That magecraft was just cast by Sakura Matou, her Master.[lr]::
30326::$$$message_0220_0067_0003$$$::Sakura is a mage, so it's no surprise to see her use a spell or two.[lr]::
30327::$$$message_0220_0067_0004$$$::But the magecraft Sakura just used is inimical to her.[lr]::
30328::$$$message_0220_0067_0005$$$::That incantation just bared her id, her deeper consciousness, to create a blade made of her darker, negative self.::
30329::$$$message_0220_0068_0000$$$::"You mustn't! It's too early for you to wield your magical energy itself as a weapon! I will fight the enemies, so please focus on maintaining the Bounded Field in the house!"[lr]::
30330::$$$message_0220_0068_0001$$$::The instant it took Rider to shout to her Master is enough of an opening to exploit.[lr]::
30331::$$$message_0220_0068_0002$$$::The dead swarm rushes toward the stopped Servant.::
30332::$$$message_0220_0069_0000$$$::"[font italic=true]Es flustert (Let my voice be prayer)...Mein Nagel reist Hauser ab. (My fingers erode the earth.)[font italic=false]"[lr]::
30333::$$$message_0220_0069_0001$$$::A sea of shadows impales the throngs of invaders, sucking them in and swallowing them into the ground.[lr]::
30334::$$$message_0220_0069_0002$$$::This is Sakura's aspect as a mage. It is a quality she has always had.[lr]::
30335::$$$message_0220_0069_0003$$$::It is her magical attribute of imaginary numbers[line len=2]a dark void that easily sends those from the afterlife back to the other side, binding its targets using unseen variables.::
30336::$$$message_0220_0070_0000$$$::"Sakura...!"[lr]::
30337::$$$message_0220_0070_0001$$$::"I'm all right. I can handle this much...![lr]::
30338::$$$message_0220_0070_0002$$$::Don't worry, Rider. I've been trying my hardest to get stronger this last half year, a little at a time!"[lr]::
30339::$$$message_0220_0070_0003$$$::Sakura strains her voice, urging herself to fight through the feedback of her magecraft and stand on shaky legs.::
30340::$$$message_0220_0071_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
30341::$$$message_0220_0071_0001$$$::Should Rider respect her Master's wishes and continue their resistance, or grab her and retreat?[lr]::
30342::$$$message_0220_0071_0002$$$::It still isn't too late to run.[lr]::
30343::$$$message_0220_0071_0003$$$::Her Noble Phantasm could carry Sakura all the way to Shinto in an instant.[lr]::
30344::$$$message_0220_0071_0004$$$::But...::
30345::$$$message_0220_0072_0000$$$::"Rider, protect the walls. I'll deal with the ones that get inside!"[lr]::
30346::$$$message_0220_0072_0001$$$::She's impressed by Sakura's determination to take to the battlefield and stand her ground.::
30347::$$$message_0220_0073_0000$$$::Normally, Sakura Matou wouldn't have the foundation to be able to use magecraft on her own.[lr]::
30348::$$$message_0220_0073_0001$$$::By pushing only her Magic Circuits that unleash shadows[line len=2]her inner darkness[line len=2]to the surface, she's temporarily functioning as a mage.[lr]::
30349::$$$message_0220_0073_0002$$$::It is akin to destroying part of what makes her human.[lr]::
30350::$$$message_0220_0073_0003$$$::In this state, even the slightest mental distress could cause her to be consumed by her negative nature.[lr]::
30351::$$$message_0220_0073_0004$$$::That is her greatest fear and shame, but she's gritting her teeth and fighting at the front.::
30352::$$$message_0220_0074_0000$$$::"[font italic=true]Es flustert (Let my voice be prayer)...Mein Nagel reist Hauser ab. (My fingers erode the earth.)[font italic=false]"[lr]::
30353::$$$message_0220_0074_0001$$$::...Come to think of it, this resistance could have been avoided. [font italic=true]Should[font italic=false] have been avoided.[lr]::
30354::$$$message_0220_0074_0002$$$::A Servant's husks have filled the town.[lr]::
30355::$$$message_0220_0074_0003$$$::Rider sensed them as soon as they burst from the dam and began roaming the night.[lr]::
30356::$$$message_0220_0074_0004$$$::But there was no need to fight them.[lr]::
30357::$$$message_0220_0074_0005$$$::They would simply pass those who are asleep.[lr]::
30358::$$$message_0220_0074_0006$$$::They could just sleep early as usual, and the husks would be gone by morning.::
30359::$$$message_0220_0075_0000$$$::"[font italic=true]Satz (My will is true)...Mein Blut widersteht Invasionen (My shadows wield the sword)...![font italic=false]"[lr]::
30360::$$$message_0220_0075_0001$$$::She suffers with each incantation.[lr]::
30361::$$$message_0220_0075_0002$$$::But her bloody lips scream[lr]::
30362::$$$message_0220_0075_0003$$$::   [font italic=true]I won't lose.[font italic=false][lr]::
30363::$$$message_0220_0075_0004$$$::Weakly, and forcefully.::
30364::$$$message_0220_0076_0000$$$::"...I have to. I have to stay here...!"[lr]::
30365::$$$message_0220_0076_0001$$$::Tonight...[lr]::
30366::$$$message_0220_0076_0002$$$::On the final midnight, only Rider and Sakura were in the Emiya residence.[lr]::
30367::$$$message_0220_0076_0003$$$::Some would advance, while others would defend. Neither told the other their choices, and only Sakura remained while the others headed to their respective destinations.[lr]::
30368::$$$message_0220_0076_0004$$$::   [font italic=true]I won't lose.[font italic=false][lr]::
30369::$$$message_0220_0076_0005$$$::When she realized this, her despair was unbearable.[lr]::
30370::$$$message_0220_0076_0006$$$::She was alone again.[lr]::
30371::$$$message_0220_0076_0007$$$::She'd been left on the sidelines, becoming the only one to be protected.::
30372::$$$message_0220_0077_0000$$$::"Ngh, hah, haah, hah... I can...keep going...!"[lr]::
30373::$$$message_0220_0077_0001$$$::She made her choice[lr]::
30374::$$$message_0220_0077_0002$$$::to stay here and fight.[lr]::
30375::$$$message_0220_0077_0003$$$::This place belongs to someone precious to her...[lr]::
30376::$$$message_0220_0077_0004$$$::"...That's right. They didn't leave me here.[lr]::
30377::$$$message_0220_0077_0005$$$::They're counting on me to protect this place!"[lr]::
30378::$$$message_0220_0077_0006$$$::...and she'll defend it until the very end, no matter what.[lr]::
30379::$$$message_0220_0077_0007$$$::She won't let Rider's loyalty pluck this feeble drop of motivation from her!::
30380::$$$message_0220_0078_0000$$$::"...They actually did leave us behind, though."[lr]::
30381::$$$message_0220_0078_0001$$$::"Stop that! No negative talk![lr]::
30382::$$$message_0220_0078_0002$$$::Come on, Rider! The shed! There's a lot of them on the shed...!"::
30383::$$$message_0220_0079_0000$$$::The purple snake runs up the wall.[lr]::
30384::$$$message_0220_0079_0001$$$::Rider descends on the avalanche of attackers.[lr]::
30385::$$$message_0220_0079_0002$$$::Black flames protect her back.[lr]::
30386::$$$message_0220_0079_0003$$$::The girl that was left behind faces down the horde of dead husks as a mage.::
30387::$$$message_0220_0080_0000$$$::Her woefully inadequate defense is unlikely to last another hour.[lr]::
30388::$$$message_0220_0080_0001$$$::Just one hour.[lr]::
30389::$$$message_0220_0080_0002$$$::It won't even make a drop in the bucket.[lr]::
30390::$$$message_0220_0080_0003$$$::The corruption will inevitably consume her valiant effort.[lr]::
30391::$$$message_0220_0080_0004$$$::Unfortunately, the husks had no minds of their own.[lr]::
30392::$$$message_0220_0080_0005$$$::If they could think, they would have cackled at the desperate resistance, decided this place wasn't worth conquering, and turned back to the front lines.::
30393::$$$message_0220_0081_0000$$$::"Hah... Aah, ah...!"[lr]::
30394::$$$message_0220_0081_0001$$$::Drained of half of her physical and magical energy, she's being driven to the end of the line.[lr]::
30395::$$$message_0220_0081_0002$$$::It's no wonder.[lr]::
30396::$$$message_0220_0081_0003$$$::They're facing overwhelming numbers, an infinite tapestry of malice that just keeps unfurling.[lr]::
30397::$$$message_0220_0081_0004$$$::One would expect her spirit to give out before her body.::
30398::$$$message_0220_0082_0000$$$::...It's like standing in a torrential downpour.[lr]::
30399::$$$message_0220_0082_0001$$$::From within the storm of ridicule and bloodlust, she can hear distant thunder and earthquakes signalling the end.[lr]::
30400::$$$message_0220_0082_0002$$$::But the horde of husks doesn't tire, coming at the defenders like a battering ram or an out-of-control train.::
30401::$$$message_0220_0083_0000$$$::"Ahhh, ah... Ri...der..."[lr]::
30402::$$$message_0220_0083_0001$$$::Her purple lips form one word: run.[lr]::
30403::$$$message_0220_0083_0002$$$::The hard-fought battle ends in cremation.[lr]::
30404::$$$message_0220_0083_0003$$$::Now she can only pray that her dying screams won't shake her foolish determination.[lr]::
30405::$$$message_0220_0083_0004$$$::And there...::
30406::$$$message_0220_0084_0000$$$::"Huh... What's that sound?"[lr]::
30407::$$$message_0220_0084_0001$$$::And there...[lr]::
30408::$$$message_0220_0084_0002$$$::"Los! Scatter them, Berserker!"[lr]::
30409::$$$message_0220_0084_0003$$$::A new guide turns her foolishness into hope.::
30410::$$$message_0220_0085_0000$$$::"Los, los, los!"[lr]::
30411::$$$message_0220_0085_0001$$$::Extreme violence rages among the enemy.[lr]::
30412::$$$message_0220_0085_0002$$$::The little girl and the giant cleaved through every obstacle in their path, cutting wide swaths through the husks with each blow and destroying the outer wall of the Emiya residence.::
30413::$$$message_0220_0086_0000$$$::"Wha..."[lr]::
30414::$$$message_0220_0086_0001$$$::Rider's speechless, of course.[lr]::
30415::$$$message_0220_0086_0002$$$::This can't even be called allied reinforcements.[lr]::
30416::$$$message_0220_0086_0003$$$::The girl and the giant are pure destruction.::
30417::$$$message_0220_0087_0000$$$::"I-Illya!? W-what are you doing here!?"[lr]::
30418::$$$message_0220_0087_0001$$$::"I stopped by because I couldn't bear to watch.[lr]::
30419::$$$message_0220_0087_0002$$$::I don't feel like taking anyone's side, but this is just too unfair."[lr]::
30420::$$$message_0220_0087_0003$$$::Illya smiles bewitchingly.[lr]::
30421::$$$message_0220_0087_0004$$$::It's like she's dancing in a ballroom, even as the husks are being annihilated around her.::
30422::$$$message_0220_0088_0000$$$::"U-unfair? Illya, do you know what these enemies are!?"[lr]::
30423::$$$message_0220_0088_0001$$$::"Of course not. I can't bear to think about all that.[lr]::
30424::$$$message_0220_0088_0002$$$::I'm talking about you and Rin. All I've heard from you is a bunch of stupid drivel.[lr]::
30425::$$$message_0220_0088_0003$$$::You're going to protect this place until the end? You're such an idiot, Sakura. You'll never beat Rin that way."::
30426::$$$message_0220_0089_0000$$$::"Huh?"[wvs][se volume=60 storage=se158.wav][lr]::
30427::$$$message_0220_0089_0001$$$::The little girl's words [se volume=60 storage=se736.wav]wipe Sakura's mind blank.[lr]::
30428::$$$message_0220_0089_0002$$$::Dumbfounded, but spirit still broken, she suddenly looks up.::
30429::$$$message_0220_0090_0000$$$::"I-Illya, what do you..."[lr]::
30430::$$$message_0220_0090_0001$$$::"I'm saying you'll never win as long as you're this passive.[lr]::
30431::$$$message_0220_0090_0002$$$::Did you know that Rin's on the front lines right now, taking up the best position for herself?[lr]::
30432::$$$message_0220_0090_0003$$$::You should be trying for a dramatic high score, not fighting a futile battle in some far-off corner."::
30433::$$$message_0220_0091_0000$$$::"U-um... That sounds more like the worst place to be than a high score..."[lr]::
30434::$$$message_0220_0091_0001$$$::"Same thing. Rin just ended up playing defense too, and that's pretty frustrating to watch.[lr]::
30435::$$$message_0220_0091_0002$$$::If you know where the enemy's home base is, it would be fastest to just crush them. And besides..."[lr]::
30436::$$$message_0220_0091_0003$$$::"Um...I-I'll get more points than my sister?"::
30437::$$$message_0220_0092_0000$$$::"Exactly.[lr]::
30438::$$$message_0220_0092_0001$$$::I'm going. I don't know if I can reach it, but I can't leave this all to Rin.[lr]::
30439::$$$message_0220_0092_0002$$$::What about you, Sakura? Want to come with me?"::
30440::$$$message_0220_0093_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
30441::$$$message_0220_0093_0001$$$::She doesn't answer in words.[lr]::
30442::$$$message_0220_0093_0002$$$::After a brief hesitation, she quietly gulps and returns Illya's gaze.[lr]::
30443::$$$message_0220_0093_0003$$$::"Then let's go.[lr]::
30444::$$$message_0220_0093_0004$$$::Come on, Berserker! This is your one chance to shine![lr]::
30445::$$$message_0220_0093_0005$$$::Don't hold back! Destroy everyone in our way, and show them how strong you are!"[lr]::
30446::$$$message_0220_0093_0006$$$::"[wacky len=12]"::
30447::$$$message_0220_0094_0000$$$::The out-of-control train continues its journey.[lr]::
30448::$$$message_0220_0094_0001$$$::Guided by the girl, the giant tears through the black snowfield.::
30449::$$$message_0220_0095_0000$$$::It's headed for the source.[lr]::
30450::$$$message_0220_0095_0001$$$::They push toward the scrapyard of husks, not knowing if they'll reach it.[lr]::
30451::$$$message_0220_0095_0002$$$::But even if they don't...[lr]::
30452::$$$message_0220_0095_0003$$$::Their actions won't be just a drop in the bucket, but a tremulous ripple.::
30453::$$$message_0220_0096_0000$$$::The interlude continues.[lr]::
30454::$$$message_0220_0096_0001$$$::Several lights pierce the darkness.[lr]::
30455::$$$message_0220_0096_0002$$$::Pinpoints of resistance too feeble to measure beat back the dark husks.[lr]::
30456::$$$message_0220_0096_0003$$$::All they accomplish is little more than putting pressure on a wound.::
30457::$$$message_0220_0097_0000$$$::It doesn't close the gap.[lr]::
30458::$$$message_0220_0097_0001$$$::They could fight to the death, and it still wouldn't change the outcome.::
30459::$$$message_0220_0098_0000$$$::The Guardian might hold the bridge, but there's no way to stop the husks from making landfall in Shinto.[lr]::
30460::$$$message_0220_0098_0001$$$::It's been half an hour since Pandemonium appeared.[lr]::
30461::$$$message_0220_0098_0002$$$::Some husks have broken off from the bridge battle, showing up as black dots beginning to roam Shinto.::
30462::$$$message_0220_0099_0000$$$::The fighting, as hard as it was, still isn't enough for them.[lr]::
30463::$$$message_0220_0099_0001$$$::The price to be paid for quiet and tedium, for all these accumulated peaceful days, is just that heavy.[lr]::
30464::$$$message_0220_0099_0002$$$::Only one thing stands against them: [lr]::
30465::$$$message_0220_0099_0003$$$::several teams of Masters and Servants.[lr]::
30466::$$$message_0220_0099_0004$$$::They lack the power to completely stem the tide, and won't last until dawn.::
30467::$$$message_0220_0100_0000$$$::...It's all too tilted in the husks' favor.[lr]::
30468::$$$message_0220_0100_0001$$$::Where, in this night when so many are asleep, can a savior be found?[lr]::
30469::$$$message_0220_0100_0002$$$::The husks sing of victory.[lr]::
30470::$$$message_0220_0100_0003$$$::"tHings WIll gO bacK to THe way THEY Were," they cry.[lr]::
30471::$$$message_0220_0100_0004$$$::They laugh at the path to the moon, at the altar that seeks it out, and rush into the city.[lr]::
30472::$$$message_0220_0100_0005$$$::But...::
30473::$$$message_0220_0101_0000$$$::"Stop.[lr]::
30474::$$$message_0220_0101_0001$$$::Do you mind quieting down a little at this hour?[lr]::
30475::$$$message_0220_0101_0002$$$::Children are supposed to be sleeping now but they can't with all this noise."::
30476::$$$message_0220_0102_0000$$$::An impossible power exists here.[lr]::
30477::$$$message_0220_0102_0001$$$::The husks have made landfall, and are eager to reach the tower.[lr]::
30478::$$$message_0220_0102_0002$$$::But little do they know...[lr]::
30479::$$$message_0220_0102_0003$$$::If they are a great wave engulfing the town, then he is a raging storm.[lr]::
30480::$$$message_0220_0102_0004$$$::They have no idea that he is the embodiment of tyranny, who will stamp out any who oppose or displease him.[haze hlimit=0 storage=fd36_反魂 intime=10 waves=(-1,1,10) lwaves=(1,1,15)]::
30481::$$$message_0220_0103_0000$$$::A strange scent hangs over the boy.[lr]::
30482::$$$message_0220_0103_0001$$$::Silver is at his feet.[lr]::
30483::$$$message_0220_0103_0002$$$::The scent surrounds him like a fog, and it makes the horde of husks tremble.::
30484::$$$message_0220_0104_0000$$$::"Hello. I won't ask who you are or where you're from, but good evening.[lr]::
30485::$$$message_0220_0104_0001$$$::There must be some great event going on, for so many of you to come out at night."[lr]::
30486::$$$message_0220_0104_0002$$$::The boy is utterly calm.[lr]::
30487::$$$message_0220_0104_0003$$$::He doesn't show a single hint of fear in front of the teeming masses of the dead.[lr]::
30488::$$$message_0220_0104_0004$$$::Rather, his innocent, cherubic face is...::
30489::$$$message_0220_0105_0000$$$::"Not that I care about whatever event it is.[lr]::
30490::$$$message_0220_0105_0001$$$::Are you all the leaders? You must be, since it seems like you deliberately all have the same face.[lr]::
30491::$$$message_0220_0105_0002$$$::Hmm...that's a problem. Isn't a leader supposed to take charge of all this? I suppose I could make the entire swarm of you pay for your failure with your heads..."[lr]::
30492::$$$message_0220_0105_0003$$$::Some ecological shift appears to run through the horde.[lr]::
30493::$$$message_0220_0105_0004$$$::Driven by single-minded purpose, the husks suddenly converge on him.::
30494::$$$message_0220_0106_0000$$$::One reason, of course, is to reach their goal.[lr]::
30495::$$$message_0220_0106_0001$$$::They instinctively sense that they'll have to use violence to reach and topple the tower ahead.[lr]::
30496::$$$message_0220_0106_0002$$$::And the other reason...::
30497::$$$message_0220_0107_0000$$$::"...If you're all leaders, then you leave me no choice.[lr]::
30498::$$$message_0220_0107_0001$$$::It's a hassle, but I'll have [font italic=true]all of you[font italic=false] take responsibility."[lr]::
30499::$$$message_0220_0107_0002$$$::The other reason is the [font italic=true]terror[font italic=false] they feel at the enemy before them, for the first time since they manifested.::
30500::$$$message_0220_0108_0000$$$::The husks stir.[lr]::
30501::$$$message_0220_0108_0001$$$::The circle of creatures around the boy widens and becomes more dense.[lr]::
30502::$$$message_0220_0108_0002$$$::At a glance, the husks fill the entire central park.[lr]::
30503::$$$message_0220_0108_0003$$$::This wasteland was once the final battleground of the Holy Grail War ten years ago, and it's turning into a hellscape once more.::
30504::$$$message_0220_0109_0000$$$::"Hmm. Where there's one rat, there's bound to be a nest, as they say... That counterfeiter and his Master have done a good job, but you're just not a good match for them.[lr]::
30505::$$$message_0220_0109_0001$$$::Honestly, you're more like a disease than an army.[lr]::
30506::$$$message_0220_0109_0002$$$::The way you multiply endlessly as long as one of you still remains...that's what I hate the most."::
30507::$$$message_0220_0110_0000$$$::The corpses form a mountain that threatens to crash down on the boy.[lr]::
30508::$$$message_0220_0110_0001$$$::He's finished if they swallow him.[lr]::
30509::$$$message_0220_0110_0002$$$::This unknown creature is just an obstacle.[lr]::
30510::$$$message_0220_0110_0003$$$::The fact remains that one will be conquered by the other.::
30511::$$$message_0220_0111_0000$$$::But wasn't their goal to conquer the tower?[lr]::
30512::$$$message_0220_0111_0001$$$::Shinto isn't like Miyama.[lr]::
30513::$$$message_0220_0111_0002$$$::Over a thousand husks have reached Shinto, but that's only a small fraction of them.[lr]::
30514::$$$message_0220_0111_0003$$$::They should be trying to reach the tower, so why...?::
30515::$$$message_0220_0112_0000$$$::"You don't even know what you're doing here?[lr]::
30516::$$$message_0220_0112_0001$$$::That sounds like how an insect would think. Honestly, incense to call back the dead sure worked well on you lot. It's wasted on you, but tonight's an open party, so there's no need for niceties.[lr]::
30517::$$$message_0220_0112_0002$$$::...Yes. [l][say storage=eming13_gil_0053 name=ギル]If you're going to sing of hell, then..."::
30518::$$$message_0220_0113_0000$$$::The boy's cheeks twist into a wicked smile.[lr]::
30519::$$$message_0220_0113_0001$$$::Glee and scorn.[lr]::
30520::$$$message_0220_0113_0002$$$::A mountain of corpses towers over his head.[lr]::
30521::$$$message_0220_0113_0003$$$::He has decreed his judgment.::
30522::$$$message_0220_0114_0000$$$::The invaders descend upon the boy to tear him apart, falling like an endless rain of buckshot.[lr]::
30523::$$$message_0220_0114_0001$$$::"A fine beginning to this play. [cacheimage storage=fd37_h1000][wvl canskip=0 time=800][clfg][fg left=0 index=1000 top=-400 storage=fd37_h1000][stopquake][movefg textoff=0 page=back opacity=255 left=0 top=0 time=12000 accel=0 storage=fd37_h1000][noise page=back monocro=0 type=ltDodge opacity=60][noise_back][transex textoff=0 time=400]Struggle to the death as you sing, worthless spite!"[lr]::
30524::$$$message_0220_0114_0002$$$::The golden annihilator descends![lr]::
30525::$$$message_0220_0114_0003$$$::He becomes a tempest to overwhelm the dark invaders and root out all sin!::
30526::$$$message_0220_0115_0000$$$::Nature[line len=2]violence[line len=2]swirls and gathers before the king, denying life[line len=2]no, forbidding existence itself.[lr]::
30527::$$$message_0220_0115_0001$$$::Overwhelming [font italic=true]truth[font italic=false] rages among the husks who sing of hell.::
30528::$$$message_0220_0116_0000$$$::"...It's time, Ea.[lr]::
30529::$$$message_0220_0116_0001$$$::This may displease you, but consider it the duty of a trailblazer. [l][say storage=eming13_gl2_0012 name=大ギル][dash textoff=0 mx=0 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=2 imag=2 time=300 cy=296 mag=2 my=0 storage=fd37b(火の粉あり) rot=-0.0 accel=0][wdash canskip=0]As one who knows Truth, let me teach you something about it!"::
30530::$$$message_0220_0117_0000$$$::The Sword of Rupture creaks in response to its master's call.[lr]::
30531::$$$message_0220_0117_0001$$$::This is the origin of all lands of death[line len=2]the source of the memories of life.[lr]::
30532::$$$message_0220_0117_0002$$$::If they sing of hell, then it creates hell.[lr]::
30533::$$$message_0220_0117_0003$$$::Before Heaven and Earth were created, this land was lava and gas. It was a hell of jumbled, extreme heat and cold.[lr]::
30534::$$$message_0220_0117_0004$$$::Even if there are no memories that recount that intense time, it is engraved into our invisible genes.[lr]::
30535::$$$message_0220_0117_0005$$$::...That's right.[lr]::
30536::$$$message_0220_0117_0006$$$::Hell is but the original shape of the primeval epoch when this serene planet was utterly inhospitable!::
30537::$$$message_0220_0118_0000$$$::"I will open the way to the underworld. Sing as you please, lost ghosts.[lr]::
30538::$$$message_0220_0118_0001$$$::Why, you won't be bored. I only show such whims once in a lifetime. [wvl canskip=false time=1000]I'll spare no expense. Wager your lives and try to survive until the dawn...!"::
30539::$$$message_0220_0119_0000$$$::The center of the cyclone is no eye of the storm. It is unmistakably an infernal pit.[lr]::
30540::$$$message_0220_0119_0001$$$::The husks who set foot in this realm plunge into the nothingness from which they came.::
30541::$$$message_0220_0120_0000$$$::The likes of Pandemonium could never endure the Truth that the King of Heroes holds high.[lr]::
30542::$$$message_0220_0120_0001$$$::The army of husks assembled in Shinto perishes.[lr]::
30543::$$$message_0220_0120_0002$$$::It can hardly be called a battle. It was literally nature's divine retribution.::
30544::$$$message_0220_0121_0000$$$::The thunder doesn't stop, and the storm continues to open the path to the underworld.[lr]::
30545::$$$message_0220_0121_0001$$$::An army landed in Shinto, and was annihilated by a one-man army.::
30546::$$$message_0220_0122_0000$$$::Tragically, this Servant has no intention of destroying them.[lr]::
30547::$$$message_0220_0122_0001$$$::He will strike down any enemy that opposes him, but he has no interest in the creatures heading for the tower.[lr]::
30548::$$$message_0220_0122_0002$$$::The lone Servant doesn't care about defending the tower. He just wants to kill the pests who annoy him.[lr]::
30549::$$$message_0220_0122_0003$$$::He is indifferent to the husks heading for the city center, who somehow survived the storm by a one-in-a-million chance.::
30550::$$$message_0220_0123_0000$$$::...And the lucky enemies are indeed infinite.[lr]::
30551::$$$message_0220_0123_0001$$$::If even one reaches the tower, then their greatest weapon is that he allows them to exist.::
30552::$$$message_0220_0124_0000$$$::   Thus, the interlude ends.[lr]::
30553::$$$message_0220_0124_0001$$$::The army of husks failed to dominate with their overwhelming numbers, but they still accomplished their goal of reaching the ladder to the moon.[lr]::
30554::$$$message_0220_0124_0002$$$::One more move.[lr]::
30555::$$$message_0220_0124_0003$$$::They just need to lay hands on the outer wall of the tower, then climb it to complete this ending.::
30556::$$$message_0220_0125_0000$$$::"HuRRY, huRRy, HurrY, hUrry...!"[rf][lr]::
30557::$$$message_0220_0125_0001$$$::Racing through the night, the tower comes into view, and their joy begins to color their resentment.[lr]::
30558::$$$message_0220_0125_0002$$$::It is the joy of knowing you've won.[lr]::
30559::$$$message_0220_0125_0003$$$::The relief of knowing you've survived.[lr]::
30560::$$$message_0220_0125_0004$$$::They don't care how far the traitor has gone.[lr]::
30561::$$$message_0220_0125_0005$$$::Once they arrive, they'll climb the stairs and welcome a new husk. A new self.::
30562::$$$message_0220_0126_0000$$$::".........?"[rf][lr]::
30563::$$$message_0220_0126_0001$$$::However...[lr]::
30564::$$$message_0220_0126_0002$$$::After several thousand of them have broken through the obstacles, they start to feel that something is off.[lr]::
30565::$$$message_0220_0126_0003$$$::They have already arrived.[lr]::
30566::$$$message_0220_0126_0004$$$::The tower should have been dyed crimson by their malice upon their arrival.[lr]::
30567::$$$message_0220_0126_0005$$$::But the tower remains darkly intact.[lr]::
30568::$$$message_0220_0126_0006$$$::The red light has crept along the ground, but remains spotty around the tower.::
30569::$$$message_0220_0127_0000$$$::"..........?" [rf][lr]::
30570::$$$message_0220_0127_0001$$$::The racing husks stop.[lr]::
30571::$$$message_0220_0127_0002$$$::The tower is enveloped by an utterly silent whirlwind which only permits a frontal advance.[lr]::
30572::$$$message_0220_0127_0003$$$::The horde halts in front of its majesty.::
30573::$$$message_0220_0128_0000$$$::Behold, countless corpses.[lr]::
30574::$$$message_0220_0128_0001$$$::You look upon a brilliant sword.[lr]::
30575::$$$message_0220_0128_0002$$$::You face the embodiment of unsullied ideals, cloaked in azure and silver armor.[lr]::
30576::$$$message_0220_0128_0003$$$::In this place[lr]::
30577::$$$message_0220_0128_0004$$$::stands a true defender who shall never fall.::
30578::$$$message_0220_0129_0000$$$::The invisible protection wreathing the tower is the mystic wind that serves as the sacred sword's scabbard.[lr]::
30579::$$$message_0220_0129_0001$$$::The arrived warriors grow excited.[lr]::
30580::$$$message_0220_0129_0002$$$::There is only one method left to them. No, it was the only one they ever had.::
30581::$$$message_0220_0130_0000$$$::The husks creep up to the obstacle facing them.[lr]::
30582::$$$message_0220_0130_0001$$$::Their instincts tell them that they can only lose, but aggression is their essence.[lr]::
30583::$$$message_0220_0130_0002$$$::"I will not ask what you are."[lr]::
30584::$$$message_0220_0130_0003$$$::The knight does not move.[lr]::
30585::$$$message_0220_0130_0004$$$::Her sword's brilliance does not waver.[lr]::
30586::$$$message_0220_0130_0005$$$::Her eyes do not wander. She stares down the dead husks before her.::
30587::$$$message_0220_0131_0000$$$::"Nor will I tell you to leave.[lr]::
30588::$$$message_0220_0131_0001$$$::This is where I will demonstrate my conviction, according to my lord's will.[lr]::
30589::$$$message_0220_0131_0002$$$::If your resentment leaves no room for hope, then our positions are clear."::
30590::$$$message_0220_0132_0000$$$::Her voice is stern but serene.[lr]::
30591::$$$message_0220_0132_0001$$$::Only the speaker of those words could possibly know the emotion behind them.[lr]::
30592::$$$message_0220_0132_0002$$$::It is as if he never bid her farewell,[lr]::
30593::$$$message_0220_0132_0003$$$::as if she has hidden this state of being deep within her heart.::
30594::$$$message_0220_0133_0000$$$::"...This ladder is reserved for those who desire the future. You have no right to set foot on it.[lr]::
30595::$$$message_0220_0133_0001$$$::Call it arrogance, if you will..."::
30596::$$$message_0220_0134_0000$$$::...She does not waver.[lr]::
30597::$$$message_0220_0134_0001$$$::He isn't the only one who will bring an end to this night.[lr]::
30598::$$$message_0220_0134_0002$$$::Everyone fighting tonight is doing it to[lr]::
30599::$$$message_0220_0134_0003$$$::smash this illusion and reach for the future they desire.::
30600::$$$message_0220_0135_0000$$$::"Now, come at me with everything you have.[lr]::
30601::$$$message_0220_0135_0001$$$::I will answer your challenge with this blade!"::
30602::$$$message_0220_0136_0000$$$::Golden light washes the dark taint away.[lr]::
30603::$$$message_0220_0136_0001$$$::Who can say whether those who travel the heavens could have known that there are stars that twinkle on the earth?::
30604::$$$message_0220_0137_0000$$$::Another interlude ends.[lr]::
30605::$$$message_0220_0137_0001$$$::The town still undulates in black and red, but sunlight will soon wipe the darkness away.::
30606::$$$message_0220_0138_0000$$$::All skygazers have perished among those fighting on the surface.[lr]::
30607::$$$message_0220_0138_0001$$$::All wills, all reunions, and all partings will end tonight.::
30608::$$$message_0220_0139_0000$$$::And there...[lr]::
30609::$$$message_0220_0139_0001$$$::One mind, who has long since fulfilled its role, watches lazily from the boundary, watches the reenactment come to an end.::
30610::$$$message_0220_0140_0000$$$::He has no words, no feelings left to say.[lr]::
30611::$$$message_0220_0140_0001$$$::A backwards, shining comet aiming for the outside.[lr]::
30612::$$$message_0220_0140_0002$$$::He will see off the unreliable, feeble spider's thread which has somehow reached its final destination.[lr]::
30613::$$$message_0220_0140_0003$$$::Dawn is near.[lr]::
30614::$$$message_0220_0140_0004$$$::The path was difficult, but it certainly continues.::
N